    slug: "cracked-tooth-root-canal",
    title: "Does a Cracked Tooth Always Need a Root Canal?",
    excerpt: "A cracked tooth does not automatically mean a root canal. Treatment ranges from monitoring to bonding, a crown, a root canal, or extraction - depending on how deep the crack goes.",
    author: AUTHOR,
    authorTitle: AUTHOR_TITLE,
